Table full name: SEC_QUARTERLY_FINANCIALS.SEC_QUARTERLY_FINANCIALS.PRESENTATION
Column name: rfile Type: TEXT Description: The type of interactive data file rendered on the EDGAR website, H = .htm file, X = .xml file.
Column name: presented_parenthetically Type: BOOLEAN Description: 1 indicates that the value was presented \"parenthetically\" instead of in fields within the financial statements. For example: Receivables (net of allowance for bad debts of USD 200 in 2012) USD 700 presented_parenthetically: [inpth]
Column name: preferred_role Type: TEXT Description: The XBRL link \"role\" of the preferred label, using only the portion of the role URI after the last \"/\". preferred_role: [prole]
Column name: version Type: TEXT Description: The taxonomy identifier if the tag is a standard tag, otherwise adsh.
Column name: preferred_label Type: TEXT Description: The text presented on the line item, also known as a \"preferred\" label. preferred_label: [plabel]
Column name: statement Type: TEXT Description: The financial statement location to which the value of the \"report\" field pertains. statement: [stmt]
Column name: negating Type: BOOLEAN Description: Flag to indicate whether the prole is treated as negating by the renderer.
Column name: submission_number Type: TEXT Description: Accession Number. The 20-character string formed from the 18-digit number assigned by the Commission to each EDGAR submission. submission_number: [adsh]
Column name: report Type: NUMBER Description: Represents the report grouping. The numeric value refers to the \"R file\" as computed by the renderer and posted on the EDGAR website. Note that in some situations the numbers skip.
Column name: measure_tag Type: TEXT Description: The tag chosen by the filer for this line item. measure_tag: [tag]
Column name: line Type: NUMBER Description: Represents the tag's presentation line order for a given report. Together with the statement and report field, presentation location, order and grouping can be derived.
Sample rows:
[{'submission_number': '0001019687-12-000977', 'report': 4, 'line': 1, 'statement': 'IS', 'presented_parenthetically': False, 'rfile': 'H', 'measure_tag': 'StatementTable', 'version': 'us-gaap/2011', 'preferred_role': 'label', 'preferred_label': 'Statement [Table]', 'negating': False}, {'submission_number': '0001019056-12-000307', 'report': 4, 'line': 1, 'statement': 'IS', 'presented_parenthetically': False, 'rfile': 'H', 'measure_tag': 'StatementTable', 'version': 'us-gaap/2011', 'preferred_role': 'label', 'preferred_label': 'Statement [Table]', 'negating': False}, {'submission_number': '0001047469-12-003164', 'report': 4, 'line': 1, 'statement': 'IS', 'presented_parenthetically': False, 'rfile': 'H', 'measure_tag': 'StatementTable', 'version': 'us-gaap/2011', 'preferred_role': 'label', 'preferred_label': 'Statement [Table]', 'negating': False}, {'submission_number': '0001104659-12-019658', 'report': 4, 'line': 1, 'statement': 'IS', 'presented_parenthetically': False, 'rfile': 'H', 'measure_tag': 'StatementTable', 'version': 'us-gaap/2011', 'preferred_role': 'label', 'preferred_label': 'Statement [Table]', 'negating': False}, {'submission_number': '0001096906-12-000314', 'report': 4, 'line': 1, 'statement': 'IS', 'presented_parenthetically': False, 'rfile': 'H', 'measure_tag': 'StatementTable', 'version': 'us-gaap/2011', 'preferred_role': 'label', 'preferred_label': 'Statement [Table]', 'negating': False}]

