Table full name: SEC_QUARTERLY_FINANCIALS.SEC_QUARTERLY_FINANCIALS.QUICK_SUMMARY
Column name: submission_number Type: TEXT Description: Accession Number. The 20-character string formed from the 18-digit number assigned by the Commission to each EDGAR submission. submission_number: [adsh]
Column name: sic Type: TEXT Description: Standard Industrial Classification (SIC). Four digit code assigned by the Commission as of the filing date, indicating the registrant's type of business.
Column name: form Type: TEXT Description: The submission type of the registrant's filing.
Column name: fiscal_year_end Type: TEXT Description: Fiscal Year End Date. fiscal_year_end: [fye]
Column name: measure_tag Type: TEXT Description: The unique identifier (name) for a tag in a specific taxonomy release. measure_tag: [tag]
Column name: fiscal_period_focus Type: TEXT Description: Fiscal Period Focus (as defined in EFM Ch. 6) within Fiscal Year. The 10-Q for the 1st, 2nd and 3rd quarters would have a fiscal period focus of Q1, Q2 (or H1), and Q3 (or M9) respectively, and a 10-K would have a fiscal period focus of FY. fiscal_period_focus: [fp]
Column name: units Type: TEXT Description: The unit of measure for the value. units: [uom]
Column name: value Type: FLOAT Description: The value. This is not scaled, it is as found in the Interactive Data file, but is rounded to four digits to the right of the decimal point.
Column name: period_end_date Type: TEXT Description: The end date for the data value, rounded to the nearest month end. period_end_date: [ddate]
Column name: ein Type: TEXT Description: Employee Identification Number, 9 digit identification number assigned by the Internal Revenue Service to business entities operating in the United States.
Column name: date_filed Type: NUMBER Description: The date of the registrant's filing with the Commission. date_filed: [filed]
Column name: version Type: TEXT Description: For a standard tag, an identifier for the taxonomy; otherwise the accession number where the tag was defined.
Column name: fiscal_year Type: NUMBER Description: Fiscal Year Focus (as defined in EFM Ch. 6). fiscal_year: [fy]
Column name: company_name Type: TEXT Description: Name of registrant from the submission table. This corresponds to the name of the legal entity as recorded in EDGAR as of the filing date.
Column name: number_of_quarters Type: NUMBER Description: The count of the number of quarters represented by the data value, rounded to the nearest whole number. \"0\" indicates it is a point-in-time value. number_of_quarters: [qtrs]
Column name: central_index_key Type: NUMBER Description: Central Index Key (CIK). Ten digit number assigned by the Commission to each registrant that submits filings. central_index_key: [cik]
Column name: date_accepted Type: NUMBER Description: The acceptance date and time of the registrant's filing with the Commission. Filings accepted after 5:30pm EST are considered filed on the following business day. date_accepted: [accepted]
Sample rows:
[{'submission_number': '0001445305-13-001733', 'company_name': 'WHITE MOUNTAINS INSURANCE GROUP LTD', 'measure_tag': 'StockRepurchaseProgramNumberOfAdditionalSharesAuthorizedToBeRepurchased', 'period_end_date': '20130630', 'value': 545496.0, 'units': 'shares', 'number_of_quarters': 0, 'version': '0001445305-13-001733', 'central_index_key': 776867, 'ein': '942708455', 'sic': '6331', 'fiscal_year_end': '1231', 'form': '10-Q', 'fiscal_year': 2013, 'fiscal_period_focus': 'Q2', 'date_filed': 20130730, 'date_accepted': 1375172040000000}, {'submission_number': '0001445305-13-001733', 'company_name': 'WHITE MOUNTAINS INSURANCE GROUP LTD', 'measure_tag': 'PaymentsForRepurchaseOfCommonStock', 'period_end_date': '20120630', 'value': 491000000.0, 'units': 'USD', 'number_of_quarters': 2, 'version': 'us-gaap/2012', 'central_index_key': 776867, 'ein': '942708455', 'sic': '6331', 'fiscal_year_end': '1231', 'form': '10-Q', 'fiscal_year': 2013, 'fiscal_period_focus': 'Q2', 'date_filed': 20130730, 'date_accepted': 1375172040000000}, {'submission_number': '0001445305-13-001733', 'company_name': 'WHITE MOUNTAINS INSURANCE GROUP LTD', 'measure_tag': 'LiabilityForUnpaidClaimsAndClaimsAdjustmentExpenseNet', 'period_end_date': '20120331', 'value': 3045400000.0, 'units': 'USD', 'number_of_quarters': 0, 'version': 'us-gaap/2012', 'central_index_key': 776867, 'ein': '942708455', 'sic': '6331', 'fiscal_year_end': '1231', 'form': '10-Q', 'fiscal_year': 2013, 'fiscal_period_focus': 'Q2', 'date_filed': 20130730, 'date_accepted': 1375172040000000}, {'submission_number': '0001445305-13-001733', 'company_name': 'WHITE MOUNTAINS INSURANCE GROUP LTD', 'measure_tag': 'IncomeLossFromContinuingOperatingsExcludingPortionAttributableToNoncontrollingInterest', 'period_end_date': '20120630', 'value': 25600000.0, 'units': 'USD', 'number_of_quarters': 1, 'version': '0001445305-13-001733', 'central_index_key': 776867, 'ein': '942708455', 'sic': '6331', 'fiscal_year_end': '1231', 'form': '10-Q', 'fiscal_year': 2013, 'fiscal_period_focus': 'Q2', 'date_filed': 20130730, 'date_accepted': 1375172040000000}, {'submission_number': '0001445305-13-001733', 'company_name': 'WHITE MOUNTAINS INSURANCE GROUP LTD', 'measure_tag': 'TradingSecuritiesEquity', 'period_end_date': '20121231', 'value': 1029700000.0, 'units': 'USD', 'number_of_quarters': 0, 'version': 'us-gaap/2012', 'central_index_key': 776867, 'ein': '942708455', 'sic': '6331', 'fiscal_year_end': '1231', 'form': '10-Q', 'fiscal_year': 2013, 'fiscal_period_focus': 'Q2', 'date_filed': 20130730, 'date_accepted': 1375172040000000}]

