Table full name: SEC_QUARTERLY_FINANCIALS.SEC_QUARTERLY_FINANCIALS.MEASURE_TAG
Column name: CREDIT_OR_DEBIT Type: TEXT Description: If datatype = monetary, then the tag's natural accounting balance from the perspective of the balance sheet or income statement (debit or credit); if not defined, then NULL. credit_or_debit: [crdr]
Column name: DATATYPE Type: TEXT Description: If abstract=1, then NULL, otherwise the data type (e.g., monetary) for the tag.
Column name: TAG_LABEL Type: TEXT Description: If a standard tag, then the label text provided by the taxonomy, otherwise the text provided by the filer. A tag which had neither would have a NULL value here. tag_label: [tlabel]
Column name: I_OR_D Type: TEXT Description: If abstract=1, then NULL; otherwise, I if the value is a point in time, or D if the value is a duration. i_or_d: [iord]
Column name: CUSTOM Type: BOOLEAN Description: 1 if tag is custom (version=adsh), 0 if it is standard. Note: This flag is technically redundant with the version and adsh fields.
Column name: ABSTRACT Type: BOOLEAN Description: 1 if the tag is not used to represent a numeric fact.
Column name: MEASURE_TAG Type: TEXT Description: The unique identifier (name) for a tag in a specific taxonomy release. measure_tag:[tag]
Column name: DOC Type: TEXT Description: The detailed definition for the tag, truncated to 2048 characters. If a standard tag, then the text provided by the taxonomy, otherwise the text assigned by the filer. Some tags have neither, in which case this field is NULL.
Column name: VERSION Type: TEXT Description: For a standard tag, an identifier for the taxonomy; otherwise the accession number where the tag was defined.
Sample rows:
[{'MEASURE_TAG': 'AdjustmentsToAdditionalPaidInCapitalAbstract', 'VERSION': 'us-gaap/2009', 'CUSTOM': False, 'ABSTRACT': True, 'DATATYPE': None, 'I_OR_D': None, 'CREDIT_OR_DEBIT': None, 'TAG_LABEL': 'Adjustments to Additional Paid in Capital [Abstract]', 'DOC': 'A roll forward is a reconciliation of an account balance from the beginning of a period to the end of a period.'}, {'MEASURE_TAG': 'ClassOfStockLineItems', 'VERSION': 'us-gaap/2009', 'CUSTOM': False, 'ABSTRACT': True, 'DATATYPE': None, 'I_OR_D': None, 'CREDIT_OR_DEBIT': None, 'TAG_LABEL': 'Class of Stock [Line Items]', 'DOC': 'Line items represent financial concepts included in a table. These concepts are used to disclose reportable information associated with domain members defined in one or many axes to the table.'}, {'MEASURE_TAG': 'DocumentInformationTable', 'VERSION': 'dei/2008', 'CUSTOM': False, 'ABSTRACT': True, 'DATATYPE': None, 'I_OR_D': None, 'CREDIT_OR_DEBIT': None, 'TAG_LABEL': 'Document Information [Table]', 'DOC': 'Container to support the formal attachment of each official or unofficial, public or private document as part of a submission package.'}, {'MEASURE_TAG': 'DocumentInformationTable', 'VERSION': 'dei/2009', 'CUSTOM': False, 'ABSTRACT': True, 'DATATYPE': None, 'I_OR_D': None, 'CREDIT_OR_DEBIT': None, 'TAG_LABEL': 'Document Information [Table]', 'DOC': 'Container to support the formal attachment of each official or unofficial, public or private document as part of a submission package.'}, {'MEASURE_TAG': 'EntitiesTable', 'VERSION': 'dei/2008', 'CUSTOM': False, 'ABSTRACT': True, 'DATATYPE': None, 'I_OR_D': None, 'CREDIT_OR_DEBIT': None, 'TAG_LABEL': 'Entities [Table]', 'DOC': 'Container to assemble all relevant information about each entity associated with the document instance'}]

