Table full name: SEC_QUARTERLY_FINANCIALS.SEC_QUARTERLY_FINANCIALS.NUMBERS
Column name: NUM_DIMENSIONS Type: NUMBER Description: Small integer representing the number of dimensions. Note that this value is a function of the dimension segments. num_dimensions: [dimn]
Column name: DATE_FRACTION Type: FLOAT Description: The difference between the reported fact date and the month-end rounded date (ddate), expressed as a fraction of 1. For example, a fact reported for 29/Dec, with ddate rounded to 31/Dec, has a datp value of minus 2/31 = -0.0645. date_fraction: [datp]
Column name: DECIMAL Type: NUMBER Description: The value of the fact \"decimals\" attribute, with INF represented by 32767. decimal: [dcml]
Column name: IPRX Type: NUMBER Description: A positive integer to distinguish different reported facts that otherwise would have the same primary key. For most purposes, data with iprx greater than 1 are not needed. The priority for the fact based on higher precision, closeness of the end date to a month end, and closeness of the duration to a multiple of three months. See fields dcml, durp and datp below.
Column name: UNITS Type: TEXT Description: The unit of measure for the value. units: [uom]
Column name: FOOTNOTE Type: TEXT Description: The plain text of any superscripted footnotes on the value, if any, as shown on the statement page, truncated to 512 characters.
Column name: PERIOD_END_DATE Type: NUMBER Description: The end date for the data value, rounded to the nearest month end. period_end_date: [ddate]
Column name: VERSION Type: TEXT Description: For a standard tag, an identifier for the taxonomy; otherwise the accession number where the tag was defined.
Column name: COMPANY_NAME Type: TEXT Description: Name of registrant from the submission table. This corresponds to the name of the legal entity as recorded in EDGAR as of the filing date.
Column name: COREGISTRANT Type: TEXT Description: If specified, indicates a specific co-registrant, the parent company, or other entity (e.g., guarantor). NULL indicates the consolidated entity. Note that this value is a function of the dimension segments. coregistrant: [coreg]
Column name: VALUE Type: FLOAT Description: The value. This is not scaled, it is as found in the Interactive Data file, but is rounded to four digits to the right of the decimal point.
Column name: NUMBER_OF_QUARTERS Type: NUMBER Description: The count of the number of quarters represented by the data value, rounded to the nearest whole number. \"0\" indicates it is a point-in-time value. number_of_quarters: [qtrs]
Column name: DIMENSION_HASH Type: TEXT Description: The 32-byte hexadecimal key for the dimensional information in the DIM data set. dimension_hash: [dimh]
Column name: FOOTNOTE_LENGTH Type: NUMBER Description: Number of bytes in the plain text of the footnote prior to truncation; zero if no footnote. footnote_length: [footlen]
Column name: DURATION_FRACTION Type: FLOAT Description: The difference between the reported fact duration and the quarter duration (qtrs), expressed as a fraction of 1. For example, a fact with duration of 120 days rounded to a 91-day quarter has a durp value of 29/91 = +0.3187. duration_fraction: [durp]
Column name: SUBMISSION_NUMBER Type: TEXT Description: Accession Number. The 20-character string formed from the 18-digit number assigned by the Commission to each EDGAR submission. submission_number: [adsh]
Column name: MEASURE_TAG Type: TEXT Description: The unique identifier (name) for a tag in a specific taxonomy release. measure_tag: [tag]
Sample rows:
[{'SUBMISSION_NUMBER': '0001104659-13-070191', 'COMPANY_NAME': 'HERON LAKE BIOENERGY, LLC', 'MEASURE_TAG': 'LongTermDebtAdditionalAnnualPaymentsPercentageOfExcessCashFlow', 'VERSION': '0001104659-13-070191', 'PERIOD_END_DATE': 20130731, 'NUMBER_OF_QUARTERS': 3, 'UNITS': 'pure', 'DIMENSION_HASH': '0x69e6d93a6bf5ad43b526872a71f26b26', 'IPRX': 0, 'VALUE': 0.25, 'FOOTNOTE': None, 'FOOTNOTE_LENGTH': 0, 'NUM_DIMENSIONS': 2, 'COREGISTRANT': None, 'DURATION_FRACTION': 0.019179106, 'DATE_FRACTION': 0.0, 'DECIMAL': 2}, {'SUBMISSION_NUMBER': '0001104659-13-070191', 'COMPANY_NAME': 'HERON LAKE BIOENERGY, LLC', 'MEASURE_TAG': 'NumberOfManagementPositions', 'VERSION': '0001104659-13-070191', 'PERIOD_END_DATE': 20130731, 'NUMBER_OF_QUARTERS': 3, 'UNITS': 'item', 'DIMENSION_HASH': '0x02ab114e712939e6bf998effc59dd19f', 'IPRX': 0, 'VALUE': 3.0, 'FOOTNOTE': None, 'FOOTNOTE_LENGTH': 0, 'NUM_DIMENSIONS': 2, 'COREGISTRANT': None, 'DURATION_FRACTION': 0.019179106, 'DATE_FRACTION': 0.0, 'DECIMAL': 32767}, {'SUBMISSION_NUMBER': '0001108078-13-000035', 'COMPANY_NAME': 'PANEX RESOURCES INC.', 'MEASURE_TAG': 'AggregateIntrinsicValueGrantsInPeriod', 'VERSION': '0001108078-13-000035', 'PERIOD_END_DATE': 20130531, 'NUMBER_OF_QUARTERS': 3, 'UNITS': 'USD', 'DIMENSION_HASH': '0x00000000', 'IPRX': 0, 'VALUE': 0.0, 'FOOTNOTE': None, 'FOOTNOTE_LENGTH': 0, 'NUM_DIMENSIONS': 0, 'COREGISTRANT': None, 'DURATION_FRACTION': 0.019179106, 'DATE_FRACTION': 0.0, 'DECIMAL': 0}, {'SUBMISSION_NUMBER': '0001108078-13-000035', 'COMPANY_NAME': 'PANEX RESOURCES INC.', 'MEASURE_TAG': 'OperatingLeasesRentExpenseNet', 'VERSION': 'us-gaap/2013', 'PERIOD_END_DATE': 20130531, 'NUMBER_OF_QUARTERS': 3, 'UNITS': 'USD', 'DIMENSION_HASH': '0x00000000', 'IPRX': 0, 'VALUE': 0.0, 'FOOTNOTE': None, 'FOOTNOTE_LENGTH': 0, 'NUM_DIMENSIONS': 0, 'COREGISTRANT': None, 'DURATION_FRACTION': 0.019179106, 'DATE_FRACTION': 0.0, 'DECIMAL': 0}, {'SUBMISSION_NUMBER': '0001108078-13-000035', 'COMPANY_NAME': 'PANEX RESOURCES INC.', 'MEASURE_TAG': 'ProceedsFromRelatedPartyDebt', 'VERSION': 'us-gaap/2013', 'PERIOD_END_DATE': 20130531, 'NUMBER_OF_QUARTERS': 3, 'UNITS': 'USD', 'DIMENSION_HASH': '0x00000000', 'IPRX': 0, 'VALUE': 0.0, 'FOOTNOTE': None, 'FOOTNOTE_LENGTH': 0, 'NUM_DIMENSIONS': 0, 'COREGISTRANT': None, 'DURATION_FRACTION': 0.019179106, 'DATE_FRACTION': 0.0, 'DECIMAL': 0}]

