Table full name: SEC_QUARTERLY_FINANCIALS.SEC_QUARTERLY_FINANCIALS.RENDERING
Column name: file_type Type: TEXT Description: The type of interactive data file rendered on the EDGAR website, H = .htm file, X = .xml file. file_type: [rfile]
Column name: parentreport Type: NUMBER Description: The value of the report field for the role where roleuri equals this parentroleuri.
Column name: menu_category Type: TEXT Description: If available, one of the menu categories as computed by the renderer: C=Cover, S=Statements, N=Notes, P=Policies, T=Tables, D=Details, O=Other, and U=Uncategorized. menu_category: [menucat]
Column name: ultimate_parent_report Type: NUMBER Description: The highest ancestor report reachable by following parentreport relationships. A note (menucat = N) is its own ultimate parent. ultimate_parent_report: [ultparentrpt]
Column name: longname Type: TEXT Description: The space-normalized text of the XBRL link \"definition\" element content.
Column name: report Type: NUMBER Description: Represents the report grouping. The numeric value refers to the \"R file\" as computed by the renderer and posted on the EDGAR website. Note that in some situations the numbers skip.
Column name: roleuri Type: TEXT Description: The XBRL \"roleuri\" of the role.
Column name: shortname Type: TEXT Description: The portion of the long name used in the renderer menu.
Column name: parentroleuri Type: TEXT Description: The XBRL roleuri of a role for which this role has a matching shortname prefix and a higher level menu category, as computed by the renderer.
Column name: submission_number Type: TEXT Description: Accession Number. The 20-character string formed from the 18-digit number assigned by the Commission to each EDGAR submission. submission_number: [adsh]
